{"path":"/zh/concepts/resumable-clarification-job/","title":"可续跑澄清作业：缺信息时暂停同一任务","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-eed091dbb16c6d4a-1","revision":"eed091dbb16c6d4adc8bd4935eb4891694a639ff9afb5e2aa400fd5795eedad3","tag":"p","quote":"用户要求在“闸机中控”包下建图，工程索引里没有唯一匹配。系统已经识别出创建动作和用例图类型，只缺挂载位置。重新开启一轮对话会丢失已确认字段，也可能重新解释出另一份意图。"},{"block_id":"adps-ee8a1e0d049f28fa-1","revision":"ee8a1e0d049f28fa0e1627c0a8232866f59440940d0d9877a1b23408461d866b","tag":"p","quote":"可续跑澄清作业把一次提问建模为持久化运行状态。系统保存作业 ID、已确认字段、待确认字段、候选项、当前阶段、恢复游标和宿主工程版本。用户补充信息后恢复原作业。"},{"block_id":"adps-18a7f9faeae46791-1","revision":"18a7f9faeae46791e5899f258f4b8a6c66239b035af9d73f179eb6224fbb560c","tag":"pre","quote":"PendingOperation = { job_id, confirmed_fields, missing_fields, candidates, stage, resume_cursor, host_revision }"},{"block_id":"adps-328e6fc6e6178fe9-1","revision":"328e6fc6e6178fe9a91afe7783e622755eebd61f10954635366f0d297e3abe33","tag":"p","quote":"恢复前重新校验候选范围和宿主版本。工程已变化时，系统回到范围解析，避免沿失效坐标继续写入。"},{"block_id":"adps-b3d4d1616e69e251-1","revision":"b3d4d1616e69e251c165c11049fab51fb473359af663bf1b3276ae5784fba942","tag":"p","quote":"弹窗只负责采集信息。正确性来自作业冻结、持久化和断点恢复。仅在内存中保存状态，无法覆盖进程重启、延迟回复和多人协作。"},{"block_id":"adps-f3bb9636596650db-1","revision":"f3bb9636596650dbc19ce94457f1b7c9346406918b15406d64a8584f6b9f8f94","tag":"li","quote":"初始研究来源：AI4MBSE 建模 Agent 项目，作者袁良锭（Liangding Yuan）；名称由 ADPS 归纳。"},{"block_id":"adps-acac6e2d0671c208-1","revision":"acac6e2d0671c2081b67d60b8593ee3db97bf7b6ad02b27a9ba16fad9b9de130","tag":"li","quote":"历史近邻：durable execution、continuation、checkpointed interrupt、workflow wait state。"},{"block_id":"adps-9183b579bf80c276-1","revision":"9183b579bf80c27654210caf8feb22f1c2acf8f50d5f27e9cff9d77347b5edeb","tag":"li","quote":"ADPS 整理：将澄清字段、候选工程对象、恢复游标和宿主版本放进同一作业合同。"},{"block_id":"adps-743b4de8c8fad102-1","revision":"743b4de8c8fad1025fec60b82cbc3451ba186867670e02df78b604cf3bd9eb89","tag":"li","quote":"定义地位：ADPS 重述。"},{"block_id":"adps-57bdf3334b75f2ef-1","revision":"57bdf3334b75f2ef23888a7d5d0622304cccd438037a66a30998c1d3f2297788","tag":"p","quote":"初始来源：AI4MBSE 建模 Agent 项目；作者：袁良锭（Liangding Yuan）。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
